                  "targets": {
                    "value": "1 willing living creature or 1 undead creature"
                  },
                  "description": {
                    "value": "You channel vital energy to heal the living or damage the undead. If the target is a willing living creature, you restore 1d8 Hit Points. If the target is undead, you deal that amount of vitality damage to it, and it gets a basic Fortitude save. The number of actions you spend when Casting this Spell determines its targets, range, area, and other parameters.\n\n**1A** The spell has a range of touch.\n\n**2A (concentrate)** The spell has a range of 30 feet. If you're healing a living creature, increase the Hit Points restored by 8.\n\n**3A (concentrate)** You disperse vital energy in a 30-foot emanation. This targets all living and undead creatures in the burst."
                  },
                  "higher_level_description": {
                    "value": "Heightened (+1): The amount of healing or damage increases by 1d8, and the extra healing for the 2-action version increases by 8."
                  },
